{
    "background_story": "Allan was a skilled martial artist and monk who had spent years studying the ancient art of Kwanon, a mystical fighting style that emphasized balance and harmony. Born in a small village in the mountains, Allan was drawn to the teachings of Kwanon as a way to connect with his ancestors and find inner peace. He spent years honing his skills, mastering the intricate movements and meditative techniques. As he delved deeper into the art, Allan discovered that Kwanon was not just a physical discipline, but a spiritual one. He began to see the world as a complex web of energies and forces, and learned to harness his own energy to achieve a state of perfect balance. With his newfound understanding, Allan traveled the world, using his mastery of Kwanon to protect the innocent and defend the weak.",
